        {
          "text": "Lino Musa wakali kweembela imbelele zya-Jetero syanyinazyala, mupaizi wa-Midyani, nkabela wakasisya imbelele zyakwe kumbo lyankanda, wasika ku-Horebu, cilundu ca-Leza. ",
