          "text": "Lino Jehova wakaamba kuti, Ncobeni ndibwene mapenzi aabantu bangu bali mu-Egepita. Ndimvwide mbubalila nkaambo kabaabo bababelesya. Ndizi buusu bwabo mbobubede, ",
