        {
          "text": "Alimwi Leza wakaambila Musa kuti, Mbuboobu mboelede kwaambila bana ba-Israyeli, Jehova Leza wabamausowanu, Leza wa-Abrahamu, Leza wa-Izaka, Leza wa-Jakobo, wandituma kulindinywe, Ndendilyo izina lyangu lyoonse; mbuboobo mbunjeelede kwiibalukwa mumazyalani amazyalani. ",
