          "text": "Koya, ukabunganye bapati baba-Israyeli, ukabaambile kuti, Jehova Leza wabamausowanu wandibonekela, Leza waAbrahamu a-Izaka a-Jakobo, wati, Ncobeni ndimubwene mbomucitilwa mu-Egepita. ",
