        {
          "text": "Lino bayooswiilila ijwi lyako, nkabela mukaye kumwami wa-Egepita, yebo abapati ba-Israyeli, mukamwaambile kuti, Jehova Leza waba-Hebrayo waswanaana aswe. Lino twakumbila kuti utuleke, tutole lweendo lwamazuba otatwe kuya munkanda, tukapailile Jehova Leza wesu. ",
